onsulting | QAREF-9001 | +$2,500.75 | ✓ — all supplied values shown.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Edit dialog does not pre-populate Category; updating silently wipes the transaction's category\", \"actual\": \"Opened Edit on \\\"QA Income Alpha Invoice\\\" (category Consulting). The Category select showed the placeholder \\\"Select category\\\" instead of Consulting, while Date/Description/Amount/Reference/Notes/Tax were pre-filled. Changed only description + amount + tax switch and clicked Update Income: the row became \\\"QA Income Alpha Invoice EDITED / +$320.00\\\" but its Category cell is now EMPTY — the previously assigned Consulting category was lost. (Delete itself works: an earlier transaction was removed via the confirm dialog.)\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created \\\"QA Test Category\\\" (Type=Income, color Purple) → appeared under Income Categories, count 4→5, swatch rgba(168,85,247). Edited it to name \\\"QA Category Renamed\\\" + color Red → card updated, swatch rgba(239,68,68). Deleted it via confirm dialog → removed, Income count back to 4.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"With Type=Expense the category list was the 8 expense categories (Office Supplies…Insurance); switching Type to Income changed it to Sales Revenue, Consulting, Interest Income, Other Income. Selected Consulting was retained on the saved transaction.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created transaction with the \\\"Tax Related\\\" switch ON → Tax column showed ✓. Edited the same transaction turning the switch OFF → Tax column is now empty.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Combined search=\\\"client\\\" + Type=Income + Category=Consulting + 2024-11-01..2024-12-05 returned exactly 2 rows, both income/Consulting/containing \\\"Client\\\" and inside the date window. \\\"Clear Filters\\\" restored all 19 transactions and totals +$50,093.25 / -$36,485.99.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Missing required fields are not identified to the user\", \"actual\": \"Submitting the Add Transaction form with empty Description and Amount does nothing: the dialog stays open, no transaction is created, but no inline error, aria-invalid, toast, or native validation message is shown anywhere (DOM scan for 'required/invalid/Please/error' returned nothing).\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Inverted date range accepted with no validation message\", \"actual\": \"Set From=2024-12-31 and To=2024-01-01. The app silently accepted the range and simply rendered \\\"No transactions found / Try adjusting your filters\\\". No error, warning, aria-invalid, or explanation that the start date is after the end date was shown, and the inputs kept the invalid values.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Transaction created with no category\", \"actual\": \"Filled Description=\\\"QA No Category Test\\\" and Amount=12.34 leaving Category as \\\"Select category\\\", clicked Add Expense. The transaction was created and appears in the table (Aug 27, 2026 / -$12.34) with an empty Category cell. No error was shown.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-24\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Deleting an in-use category is allowed and orphans its transactions\", \"actual\": \"The \\\"Utilities\\\" expense category showed \\\"2 transactions\\\". Its delete was neither blocked nor did it offer reassignment — the confirm dialog only said \\\"Transactions using this category will not be deleted.\\\" After confirming, Expense Categories went 8→7 and both affected transactions (\\\"QA Expense Beta Utilities\\\" Aug 27 2026 -$1,234.56 and \\\"Electric Bill\\\" Dec 5 2024 -$285.00) now display a BLANK Category cell in the Transactions table.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After adding the Aug 27 2026 income of $2,500.75, Dashboard Monthly Income changed $0→$2,501, Net Profit/Loss $0→$2,501, Aug bar appeared in the trend chart, and the transaction is now first in Recent Transactions. (Delete of the earlier test transaction also removed it from the list immediately.)\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Unmarking tax-related: 2026 Tax Summary went from $2,500.75 taxable / 1 transaction to $0.00 / 0 transactions and Tax column emptied. Re-marking it (amount now $320): 2026 summary shows Total Taxable Income $320.00, Consulting 100%, 1 transaction listed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Consulting was \\\"3 transactions / $10,800\\\" before. After creating the $2,500.75 Consulting income it became 4 transactions; after editing that transaction's amount to $320 the card now shows \\\"4 transactions / $11,120\\\" (= 10,800 + 320), so both count and total track creates and changes.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicked \\\"Print Report\\\" for year 2024; window.print() was invoked exactly once (stub counter = 1), page remained rendered, 0 console errors.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Transactions table has columns Date, Description, Category, Reference, Amount, Tax, Actions, plus footer \\\"Total Income +$50,093.25\\\" and \\\"Total Expenses -$36,485.99\\\" for the current result set (matches 47,592.50 + 2,500.75).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Current month (Aug 2026) contains exactly two transactions: +$320.00 (Consulting) and -$1,234.56 (Utilities). Dashboard shows Monthly Income $320, Monthly Expenses $1,235, Net Profit/Loss -$915, and both appear at the top of Recent Transactions. Reports > August 2026 shows Total Income $320, Total Expenses $1,234.56, Net -$914.56, Income by Category Consulting $320, Expenses by Category Utilities $1,234.56 — all match.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Chart Y-axis labels lack precision; non-zero value indistinguishable from zero\", \"actual\": \"With current-month income of $320.00, the Dashboard \\\"Income vs Expenses\\\" chart renders a visible non-zero income bar (rect height 216px) but all five Y-axis tick labels read \\\"$0k\\\" ($0k, $0k, $0k, $0k, $0k). The axis formatter rounds to whole thousands, so $320 is indistinguishable from $0. (Also seen earlier at $2,500.75: ticks $0k, $1k, $1k, $2k, $3k with duplicate labels.)\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
